name:  Camp Grounds
theme: camp
notes: South = emerge from the (off-map) summoning room into a CAMP (gathering commons + fire pit, dirt ring road, encircling tents); street north to a WIDE sparring arena, all 3 raid entrances on the north wall (aligned to forest clearings = three lanes); deep ragged forest on top (non-overlapping 3x3 trees).
